   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Перевалочный пункт"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_999117_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A storage hub a hauler thrall docks at; manages chests within its service radius."
   },
