   },
   "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693023_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Insulated"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "С защитой"
   },
   "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693023_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Irukian Right Sloping Wall"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ирукская стена с наклоном вправо"
   },
   "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693024_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A sloped wall made of cut stone blocks"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Скатная секция стены из тёсаных каменных блоков"
   },
   "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693024_ShortDesc"
  },
