    "Text": "Ornate bracers worn by Setite devotees."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Узорные наручи последователей Сета."
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210186_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
