   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210197_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Gold and scale, fang and tribute: the servants of Set learned that devotion was not always hidden in shadow. Sometimes it gleamed on the skin, bright enough to invite a knife.</>\r\n\r\nThis legwrap is part of a medium armor set worn by the faithful of Set.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Blood Tribute: While wearing a Setite armor set, dealing or taking damage can consume Blood from your inventory to increase your Sanguine damage by up to 10%. Killing a human empowers your next attack with bonus Sanguine damage and Sibilant Poison.</>\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Sanguine magic damage sometimes deals a burst of true damage based on the target's missing health, healing you if the burst kills them.</>"
