   "Key": "FCA0180B48AFC38711A979B08DEEAFC4"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Whether raised in celebration, offered in hospitality, or displayed as a symbol of status, the tankard has long been a fixture of civilized life. Crafted with care and designed to endure, it serves equally well at a noble banquet or a humble gathering among friends."
