   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Урон по вам от эффектов Highmane удвоен"
   },
   "Key": "8A1F479949539F18803E99A5823FD640"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rejuvenation can't activate while this buff is active (Rejuvination Talisman)"
   },
   "Translation": {
