   "Key": "1BE35EA84E5AB887ECC909BD52DAF6DB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Empowered +{0}%"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Мощь +{0}%"
   },
   "Key": "0116F02342A95EADFE10CB85C4685014"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Outgoing weapon damage increased by +{empower}%"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Урон от оружия +{empower}%"
   },
   "Key": "20147C31452A4255F523FB8642DE5DA8"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You are Empowered, increasing outgoing Agility & Strength weapon damage by +{x}%."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Мощь: +{x}% к урону от проворства и силы."
   },
   "Key": "FCA3BDA74E8CF906EB4927AD44C26820"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You are Energized, increasing stamina regeneration rate by +{x}%."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Бодрость: +{x}% к восстановлению запаса сил."
   },
   "Key": "A1AB0215437F5A74F9CB059BC6BBAE19"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stamina recovery speed is increased by 25%"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Запас сил восстанавливается на 25% быстрее"
   },
   "Key": "FB3ED0DA40C4989431C7DA8231636647"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You are Fortified, increasing your armor value by +{x}."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Укрепление: +{x} к доспеху."
   },
   "Key": "4FD214754AB2B8E83B5C619750C41BBD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Armor increased by {0}"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Броня улучшена на {0}"
   },
   "Key": "988F9A714FFF22F238E09ABE98131544"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You are Healthy, increasing your Maximum Health by +{x}."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Крепкое здоровье: +{x} к максимальному здоровью."
   },
   "Key": "7E6367E74FECE09A8B5538BA8FF717B7"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Health increased by {0}"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Здоровье +{0}"
   },
   "Key": "08E1E1DB458FBCB10C33EA99E9C2F9B0"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You are Unhealthy, decreasing your Maximum Health by {x}."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Слабое здоровье: максимальное здоровье снижено на {x}."
   },
   "Key": "C61F685B44932FCB7626AA891CDBFEDF"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Maximum Health decreased by {0}"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Максимальное здоровье снижено на {0}"
   },
   "Key": "3DB91E3742808D59972E3F8E8D8B8888"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Your next attack has 25% increased Penetration."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "+25% к пробиванию следующей атаки."
   },
   "Key": "8585B64A4CC4031621F421ACEA7C3E01"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Deals 8 damage per stack when debuff expires"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Когда ослабление закончится, наносит 8 урона за каждый заряд"
   },
   "Key": "D4A7A3B54494187032077CBD701EEB96"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rejuvenation can't activate while this buff is active (Rejuvination Talisman)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Пока действует этот эффект, омоложение не срабатывает (талисман омоложения)"
   },
   "Key": "AE7D9F6744580F8E86EF96B15D512C46"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
