   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490239_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The model and textures belong to Kali, thanks for open sourcing your mod! While you are blocking and an enemy hits the shield, they are inflicted with a 34% armor reduction debuff for 15 seconds. "
