   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490372_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The wealth of Hyborian nations is built upon the backs of their beasts of burden and those who know how to handle an animal. And the mark of a man can be weighed by the manner in which he treats the least of his animals. Feed them and give them a place to live and they can be the greatest allies in the world. Neglect them and reap the consequences."
