   "Source": {
    "Text": "Skullcap Helm"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Шлем-цервельер"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491767_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A protective headpiece designed for open-field warfare"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Шлем для сражений в открытом поле"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491767_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
