    "Text": "(HA) Невидимый меч"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491951_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "One handed sword with a curved blade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Одноручный меч с изогнутым клинком"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491951_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Have you heard about the warriors from Hammerfell?"
   },
