  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Monstrous Centipede Pet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Питомец: чудовищная сороконожка"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492268_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An alchemical nightmare that will fight for you"
   },
