  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Here you can find an overview of the different Boss Spawners\r\nIncluding their locations, recommended level,\r\n recommended gear tier, and the items you can obtain from each boss.\r\n\r\nSelect a spawner from the list to continue."
   },
